      "text": "እቶም ደማሙ ንኣንጭዋታት ክጥይቕዎምን መርዓ ከዳልውን ወሰኑ።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=21105#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:64de5f5ec4a32945acce7697471d8d3745bfd1b1dc0cc2f39518e8e791db6470"
    },
    {
