      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18934.png",
      "text": "እቶም ኣናፁ ነቶም ደማሙ “ክትበልዑና ኢኹም ደሊኹም” በልዎም።",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=21105#page=9",
